            "Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.": [
                "Trustpilot recenzije se preuzimaju jednom dnevno u pozadini i \u010duvaju se na va\u0161em sajtu, tako da optere\u0107ena stranica ne ko\u0161ta ni\u0161ta dodatno na va\u0161em Trustpilot nalogu; ako osve\u017eavanje ne uspe, poslednje recenzije ostaju. Google ne dozvoljava da se njegove recenzije skladi\u0161te, tako da se u\u010ditavaju u\u017eivo kada posetilac pregleda stranicu: svaki pregled predstavlja jedan zahtev na va\u0161em sopstvenom Google klju\u010du, koji Google napla\u0107uje."
